{
  "$comment": "Locked HERO-1 direction A 'Closing Bell' (user pick 2026-10-20). Values mirror wargames/hero-directions/index.html #a. Consumed by HERO-2 (visual) and HERO-3 (layout) as hero-scoped CSS variables (--hero-*).",
